<p>You try to sever the spine of your foe, reducing its global speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">14%, 29%, 37%, 42%, 46%</acronym> for 4 turns and dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">100%, 116%, 129%, 140%, 150%</acronym> weapon damage.</p><p>The power of the blow also removes up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 1, 1, 1, 1</acronym> physical effects.</p><p>If your talent level is at least 3 <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 1, 1, 1, 1</acronym> physical or magical sustains are also removed.</p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">Break them, grind them, mow them down!</span></span></p>